<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89874" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσπάθ-εια</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>passionate attachment</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι γένος ἀκρασίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dicaearch.
					1.10
				</span></i>
			; defined as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθυμία
			δεδουλωμένη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Andronic.
			</span></i> Rhod. <i><span class="en">
				p.572
			</span></i> M.; written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσπαθία</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.14
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνευ προσκλίσεως καὶ προσπαθείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					1.230
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενομένους ἐν π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Heraclit.
				<u>Incred.</u>
				16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσπαθείας
			&lt;ἕνεκα</span>&gt; Zos.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.118
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in later Philos.,
				<i>clinging</i> of the soul to the body and its passions,
				<i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ πρὸς τὸ σῶμα π</span>.
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				29
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ θνητὴ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>in CA</u>
				3p.425M.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				12.3
			</span></i>.</div>
